graph TD
    subgraph Public Ingress Subnet
        INGRESS[Cloud Load Balancer / Nginx Ingress]
    end

    subgraph Private Kubernetes Application Subnet
        POD_GW[API Gateway Pods]
        POD_CORE[Core Service Pods]
        POD_ML[FRAUDGUARD Python Pods]
    end

    subgraph Isolated Data Subnet (No Internet Access)
        DB[(PostgreSQL Database Cluster)]
        REDIS[(Redis Cache Cluster)]
    end

    INGRESS -->|HTTPS TLS 1.3| POD_GW
    POD_GW -->|Internal mTLS| POD_CORE & POD_ML
    POD_CORE & POD_ML -->|Private DB Driver| DB & REDIS
